        <mxCell id="legendtext" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;──►&amp;nbsp; runtime data flow&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ╌╌► control / lifecycle (spawn · handshake · IPC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;grey = hardware&amp;nbsp; ·&amp;nbsp; blue = sidecar&amp;nbsp; ·&amp;nbsp; orange = AI core&amp;nbsp; ·&amp;nbsp; green = storage&amp;nbsp; ·&amp;nbsp; purple = UI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;track_id from BoT-SORT is what makes the log one row per ITEM, not per FRAME.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
